    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "They... retreated way too quickly..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Just who are they..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
